docs {
  # POST /api/artworks/artworks/:slug/visit/ — Record an artwork view
  
  Atomically increments the artwork's `views_count` (+1) and returns the
  new count. Feeds the artist profile "Más visitados" block (works ordered
  by `-views_count`).
  Public endpoint, no `Authorization` header. Throttled: `artwork_views`
  20/hour per client (`429` when exceeded — wait and retry).
  
  Takes no request body — any body is ignored.
  
  Replace `ciudad-reflejada` below with any active artwork slug (seed slugs
  work; unknown or inactive slugs return `404` and increment nothing).
  Call once per artwork detail-page mount, fire-and-forget: never block
  render, never retry on failure.
  
  ## Status codes
  
  - `200 OK` — view counted, returns the new total
  - `404 Not Found` — unknown slug, inactive artwork, or inactive artist
  - `429 Too Many Requests` — throttled (20 views/hour per client)
  
  ## Response (200)
  
  ```json
  {
    "views_count": 42
  }
  ```
  
  ## Error (404/429)
  
  ```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "Not found.",
    "data": {}
  }
  ```
}
